{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたんお誕生日おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたんとは、最初の頃待ち合わせをして一緒にダンスレッスンに行ってたよね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたんはまあやが悩んでた時に自分のことみたいに思ってくれる優しくて頼もしいお姉ちゃんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きだよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日は学校から帰って、若月ちゃんの出てるRの法則を見ようとワクワクして帰ったら........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄く残念だったので今度若月ちゃん家行って見ようと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかちゅきちゃん今度行かせてね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪カットしたよ〜どうかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前の原宿に続き、また髪を切りに代官山に行ってきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カットをしてから、ますますヒヨコって言われてます〜汗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして私、ついにモテキがきました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってね、今日レッスンルーム行ったら、白石まいちゃんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『まあや今度遊ぼっ♪』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言われたよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと、帰りにチームNの能條ちゃん、ちはるん、あしゅりんに\nご飯にも誘われたよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の日学校だったし、遅かったので、また誘って"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っといったけど、行きたかったなぁ\nまた誘ってね！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、永島せいらりんと川後のひなちゃんにも焼鳥食べに行こう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っと誘われちゃった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにクラスの友達にも誘われたよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モテキ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑後ろの席の友達が書いてくれた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ろ向いたら書いててビックリした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しかったのだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Thank You"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とまとお姉ちゃんとの整体も楽しかった...又誘ってくれるかな〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑新曲衣装(制服のマネキン)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと前回写メの答えを書くのを忘れてました  教えてくれてありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんごだよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当たった方が多かったですね\nすごい!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とてもいい香りがするよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様からの質問なかなか書けなくてごめんなさい(*_*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度また質問返しをするので待ってて下さい(・・;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントで、すべての事に感謝し、ガッツで頑張れ!!って書いてくれてる方が居て...本当そうだな〜って思った"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやを思ってくれる乃木坂familyの方やメンバーの皆、スタッフさん達や"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校の友達や先生、家族や地元の友達...居てくれて\n本当ありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"居てくれると思うと、とてもパワーになります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝してます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は三つもテストがあるのでこれから頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874073/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆明日は何するのかな〜！？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/06/8874